  "oral_argument": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "36d580a49e0224a0cc5d59f1120e305f32eb5015b098dadd47100faaab4bc370",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-36d580a49e02-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioners asked for conversion to Chapter\u202f7 so that the Chapter\u202f7 trustee could pursue the fraudulent\u2011transfer claim."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondents",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "36d580a49e0224a0cc5d59f1120e305f32eb5015b098dadd47100faaab4bc370",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-36d580a49e02-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Respondents contended that a court cannot order distribution of assets that would violate the priority scheme."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. Harrington",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "36d580a49e0224a0cc5d59f1120e305f32eb5015b098dadd47100faaab4bc370",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-36d580a49e02-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 22,
              "start": 22
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Ms.\u202fHarrington explained that state assets belong to the estate, not to the debtor or a subset of creditors."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. LANDAU",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "36d580a49e0224a0cc5d59f1120e305f32eb5015b098dadd47100faaab4bc370",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-36d580a49e02-0002-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 51,
              "start": 51
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. LANDAU, mr.\u202fLandau argued that the absolute priority rule does not apply to plan assets before a plan is confirmed."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. LANDAU",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "36d580a49e0224a0cc5d59f1120e305f32eb5015b098dadd47100faaab4bc370",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-36d580a49e02-0002-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. LANDAU, mr.\u202fLandau suggested the dispute could be resolved through the traditional \u00a7\u202f363(b) analysis, which allows for \u201cplay in the joints,\u201d unlike the absolute priority rule."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. LANDAU",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "36d580a49e0224a0cc5d59f1120e305f32eb5015b098dadd47100faaab4bc370",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-36d580a49e02-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 39,
              "start": 39
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. LANDAU, mr.\u202fLandau warned that the respondents\u2019 objection to distribution would \u201ccome back to bite them\u201d because there is no legal difference between a distribution of assets on the first day and the pre\u2011petition wage and benefit claims."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Sun Life",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "36d580a49e0224a0cc5d59f1120e305f32eb5015b098dadd47100faaab4bc370",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-36d580a49e02-0003-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 58,
              "start": 58
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Sun Life, sun\u202fLife, via Mr.\u202fLandau, said that without a global settlement of the WARN claim, Sun did not want a settlement that would fund litigation against it."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "36d580a49e0224a0cc5d59f1120e305f32eb5015b098dadd47100faaab4bc370",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-36d580a49e02-0003-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 63,
              "start": 63
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioners (via Ms.\u202fSpinelli) argued that \u00a7\u202f363(b) does not permit distribution of estate assets in violation of priority."
      }
    ],
